19261:The fo:max-height attribute specifies the maximum height of a text box when the minimum height has been set using the fo:min-height 20.212 attribute. When this maximum value is reached, the text box stops increasing in height. The units of measure for this attribute shall match those used for the corresponding fo:min-height attribute.
